1
00:00:00,833 --> 00:00:01,963
(Sheldon:)Do they know it's there?

2
00:00:01,968 --> 00:00:04,068
Um, sh-should I tell somebody?

3
00:00:04,070 --> 00:00:05,970
(Amy:)It's there on purpose.

4
00:00:05,972 --> 00:00:07,942
(Amy:)It's refreshing.

5
00:00:12,445 --> 00:00:13,975
(Sheldon:)Interesting.

6
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:15,550
(Sheldon:)The world's most boring liquid

7
00:00:15,548 --> 00:00:17,318
(Sheldon:)and the world's
most boring vegetable.

8
00:00:17,317 --> 00:00:19,887
(Sheldon:)But you put 'em together,
and bleh.

9
00:00:21,821 --> 00:00:23,321
(Leonard:)Hey.
Hi.

10
00:00:23,323 --> 00:00:25,553
Oh! Good, you're here.
Are you still fighting?

11
00:00:25,558 --> 00:00:28,128
(Sheldon:)If you get divorced,
do I get two Christmases?

12
00:00:28,127 --> 00:00:30,627
(Penny:)We're not getting divorced.

13
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:33,060
(Leonard:)Listen, we realized, that, uh...

14
00:00:33,066 --> 00:00:35,236
(Leonard:)we're facing some new challenges

15
00:00:35,234 --> 00:00:36,434
(Leonard:)as a married couple.

16
00:00:36,436 --> 00:00:37,536
(Penny:)Yeah. And there are a few things

17
00:00:37,537 --> 00:00:39,367
(Penny:)we need to stay on top of.
So we thought

18
00:00:39,372 --> 00:00:41,402
(Penny:)it would useful...

19
00:00:41,407 --> 00:00:43,607
(Penny:)and I can't believe
I am about to say this...

20
00:00:43,609 --> 00:00:45,039
(Amy:)um...

21
00:00:45,044 --> 00:00:47,614
(Leonard:)Would you please help us
make a Relationship Agreement?

22
00:00:50,016 --> 00:00:52,416
(Leonard:)But one that's tailored to us.

23
00:00:52,418 --> 00:00:54,418
Okay? We don't need
a bathroom schedule.

24
00:00:54,420 --> 00:00:57,050
(Penny:)Although a rule about him
texting me from in there

25
00:00:57,056 --> 00:01:01,026
(Penny:)might help with the romance.

